SUMMARY:Stick Figures: Figurative Sculpture
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to create figurative sculptures in this three-day workshop! Students will explore the basics of building a figure sculpture and learn how to use skewer sticks to support and bring their imaginative clay figures to life. Finally\, participants will apply colorful glaze to complete their pieces. No prior experience is needed.\n● Day 1: Construct a practice figure and learn the fundamentals of figure sculpting\n● Day 2: Create your own figure with instructor guidance and troubleshooting support\n● Day 3: Glazing\nInstructor: Vex Rios (They/Them/Theirs)\nAGES 15+\nPrice: $150\nTime: Thursdays\, 5:30-8:00 pm\nWorkshop date:\nJuly 16-July 30
